=1749897689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In this impossible maze, you can merge both halves of the split screen into one and thus hop from one side of the screen over to the other. Use this ability to your advantage! It\u2019s up to you to rearrange and manipulate the level structures of 30 carefully crafted levels in order to carve out a path to the exit. Many have tried to figure out the numerous mind-boggling challenges hidden in the depths of this cursed labyrinth. Will you be the first to solve them?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/791470/extras/8f69e2447a631b1c959eae5773066c72.poster.avif?t=1749897689\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/791470/extras/8f69e2447a631b1c959eae5773066c72.webm?t=1749897689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/791470/extras/8f69e2447a631b1c959eae5773066c72.mp4?t=1749897689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Team DYO</h2>DYO started out as a holiday project of four Game Design students in 2014. Since then, DYO has come a long way: It\u2019s 2018 and \u2013 after winning several awards and having been exhibited all over the world \u2013 DYO is now finally available on Steam. So grab a copy, grab a friend and get ready for 30 levels of mind-bending puzzle action!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Good old local co-op fun for 1 or 2 players.<br></li><li>Merge and split your screens to manipulate the level around you.<br></li><li>No precision platforming. No enemies. No timers. Just you and your brains.<br></li><li>30 levels (3-4 hours of playtime) of mind-bending puzzles and more to come.<br></li><li>Find multiple solutions to each level (some of which not even the devs might know of).<br></li><li>Don't have two controllers to play with your friend? You can also play on one shared controller!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recommendation</h2>For the best DYO experience, we recommend playing with a friend!","developers":["Team DYO","Josia Roncancio"],"dlc":[806050],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/791470/header.jpg?t=1749897689","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/791470/144396/2a4cb210815167a5ff21f2194f7e91b9924ac9a0/1751145284/dash_av1.mpd?t=1517859817","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/791470/144396/2a4cb210815167a5ff21f2194f7e91b9924ac9a0/1751145284/dash_h264.mpd?t=1517859817","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/791470/144396/2a4cb210815167a5ff21f2194f7e91b9924ac9a0/1751145284/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1517859817","id":256707270,"name":"DYO - Steam Release Announcement","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256707270/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1517859817"}],"name":"DYO","package_groups":[],"packages":[381478],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0GHz Intel dual core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4600 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Team DYO"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"},"igrs":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Interaksi Daring","rating":"3","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"3","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{